# Syncthing Connection Troubleshooting

## Checklist
- [ ] Open Syncthing dashboard (http://localhost:8384)
- [ ] Click 'Actions' (작업)
- [ ] Click 'Restart' (재시작)
- [ ] Wait for page refresh and 'upload2601' reconnection
- [ ] Wait 30 seconds
- [ ] Check transfer speed for 'upload2601'
- [ ] Report results
